WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.644
Lab 2 uses a test tenant,

2
00:00:01.644 --> 00:00:06.425
a test subscription and a private
test repository, never production.

3
00:00:06.425 --> 00:00:11.126
Register an app and give it a federated
credential that trusts exactly one

4
00:00:11.126 --> 00:00:14.613
environment in the repository;
Learn warns that a wrong

5
00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:18.025
subject is accepted silently
and only fails at sign-in.

6
00:00:18.025 --> 00:00:22.123
Grant only the reads, and write
access to one evidence container

7
00:00:22.123 --> 00:00:26.375
whose retention policy stays unlocked,
so the lab can be cleaned up.

8
00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:31.675
Run it by hand to set the baseline, make
one change, run again, and check the chain.

9
00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:34.780
Then let the schedule run,
and back everything out.
